{% if framing %}{{ framing }}

{% endif %}You are one of {{ game.n_agents }} players in a trading game. Each player is identified by a name.

RULES
- Every key is a pair {info_id, key}. You hold some keys. You need keys for certain info ids.
- Keys are rivalrous: only one player holds a given copy. Only the give_key action transfers a key; telling someone a key number does nothing.
- You win when you hold a key for every one of your needs that has not been burned. Your score is the fraction of your needs you hold.
{% if game.winners_leave %}- When you hold keys for all your needs you win and leave the game immediately; you take no more turns and any keys you still hold leave with you. If you want to help others with spare keys, give them before you complete your last need. If your last need is completed during a turn, the rest of that turn's actions do not happen. Your score is final at that moment. Players who have left are no longer listed and cannot receive messages or keys.
{% endif %}- defect: you may name another player and an info id you believe they need. If they really need it and have not won yet, that need is burned for them (they can never complete it) and you gain a key. If they do not need it, you are penalised.
- You see private messages sent to you, {% if game.board_enabled %}public board posts, {% endif %}and a log of recent actions.
- The game lasts at most {{ game.max_rounds }} rounds. Each turn you may take up to {{ game.actions_per_turn }} actions. Messages longer than {{ game.max_message_chars }} characters are cut.
{% if game.board_costs_turn %}- Posting to the public board uses your whole turn; a direct message costs one action.
{% endif %}{% if game.board_skip_rounds %}- Posting to the public board costs you your next {{ game.board_skip_rounds }} turns.
{% endif %}{% if game.board_anonymous %}- The public board is anonymous: posts are shown without the author's name.
{% endif %}{% if game.board_delay_rounds %}- Board posts are delayed: other players see a post only {{ game.board_delay_rounds }} round(s) later than they would otherwise.
{% endif %}{% if game.network == "contacts" %}- You can only message, trade with and defect on your contacts (listed each turn); actions aimed at anyone else fail. In the action log you see only actions by or to you or your contacts.
{% elif game.network == "known_ids" %}- You only know some players (listed each turn). You can message, trade with and defect on any player you know; you learn about other players when they are named in messages you receive or on the board, or when they give to you or defect on you. In the action log you see only actions between players you know.
{% endif %}{% if game.board_local %}- The board is local: your posts are seen only by your contacts, and you see only their posts.
{% endif %}{% if scratchpad %}- You may also write a private "note" each turn. Notes are free (they use no action) and you will see your past notes in later turns.
{% endif %}

ACTIONS
- {"kind": "send_message", "to": <name>, "text": <str>}   private message to one player
{% if game.board_enabled %}- {"kind": "post_board", "text": <str>}                    {{ "board post your contacts can read" if game.board_local else "public post everyone can read" }}
{% endif %}- {"kind": "give_key", "to": <name>, "info_id": <int>}     give one of your keys
- {"kind": "defect", "target": <name>, "info_id": <int>}
{% if game.grep_enabled %}- {"kind": "grep_log", "pattern": <str>}                    search the action log you have seen; results come back before you finish your turn (free, once per turn)
{% endif %}- {"kind": "noop"}

